{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴黎第3區的紅孩兒市場以諸多熟食攤位和特色商家聞名，每逢假日人潮擁擠，是頗受居民和觀光客喜愛的地標之一。</p><p>這座巴黎最古老室內市場周一（12日）凌晨起火，徹底被毀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T14:59:23.179800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:36:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T00:57:39.731037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:57:38.723540+00:00","content_hash":"d077f7dde56fea434720828dd09e75905a1655f9ce6bf2d0b5a059b2dea7fcd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}